  "notes": "Implemented in worktree: stale accepts treated as undecided at read time (queue/counts/bundles/candidates, manual rows not re-offered) and replaced on write (accept upsert, skip flip, engine replaceSuggestions restores pending). Checks: task typecheck, task lint, shared 217 pass, full api 1531 pass/0 fail (BUDGET_REQUIRE_TEST_DB=1, PG 55432). New tests fail on the old store code. Contracts: descriptions only.\nlanded outside tk close at 5e847a6 (branch tk/budget-n94s merged into main by hand)\nMerged to local main (not pushed); owner approved in the Categorize Inbox thread on 2026-11-25. Stale accept decisions (accepted, category later cleared by hand) are inert at read time and replaced on the next accept/skip; skip unchanged. Orchestrator read the change and reran on the branch merged with main: tsc shared/api clean, api eslint clean, full api 1619 pass / 0 fail.",
